a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"东郊","author":"范梈","text":"东郊芳草绿萋萋，欲到浑如恋马蹄。\n总是都门好春色，随人直到大江西。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8043,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"范梈","text":"幽人不出户长开，看尽春风长绿苔。\n多谢有情双燕子，暂时飞去又飞来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8044,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀南省海棠，感新事作","author":"范梈","text":"海棠花发醉题诗，犹记西垣下直时。\n今日岂无歌舞地？\n一尊先被外人知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8045,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠聊城施生","author":"范梈","text":"京国相逢意若何，向人平谳路人歌。\n皋陶此去为廷尉，似子宁疑一掾多？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8046,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠盛复之之官宣德","author":"范梈","text":"帝城谷雨见黄鹂，关外风光大较迟。\n想得牡丹花落后，先生初是到官时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8047,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"戏题张平章所赠洪生书后","author":"范梈","text":"一翁二季向皇都，未必遭逢事太殊。\n祇惜翰林欧学士，当时书让蔡君谟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8048,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠水鉴道人写真","author":"范梈","text":"鉴尽公卿写尽真，此心澄彻故通神。\n世间未用论沧海，何日河流照得人？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8049,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"十二月十九日，候进贤，该吏不至，看野人家道书","author":"范梈","text":"社农家近白鸥沙，再系停骖候蚤霞。\n闲启古囊看法箓，此身如到玉清家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8050,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送萨佥宪至岩头渡","author":"范梈","text":"石头渡口风烟古，洗盏开樽对浅沙。\n却唤掾曹无觅处，移船幽寺看黄花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8051,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"小年日，仍宿北山","author":"范梈","text":"腊日才过又小年，那堪泽国雨连天！\n儿童把酒传明烛，远想慈亲尚未眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8052,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题秋林图","author":"范梈","text":"霜树前头欲下禽，远行逢有慕归心。\n佳人昨日天际去，红蓼作花秋正深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8053,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"孝友堂","author":"范梈","text":"堂前多种紫荆枝，堂上能啼白发儿。\n但恨后来风雅废，南陔不似古人诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8054,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"戏题奉寄行营董佥事","author":"范梈","text":"五月沙山铁骑罗，将军无那太平何！\n帐前养得堂人鹿，祇爱行营芳草多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8055,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和揭曼硕茂才，揭尝过临不遇，留题墙壁","author":"范梈","text":"麻姑蚤解鬓成霜，况说山中海与桑。\n久别南城坛近客，西风残照忆题墙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8056,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题烟雨图","author":"范梈","text":"似有江南布谷声，乱流触石野桥平。\n何由招得鱼竿客？\n共上西峰看晚晴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8057,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题稚川芦雁图","author":"范梈","text":"不见罗生心惘然，画图河朔尽流传。\n沧洲旧隐无人识，正似寒芦落雁边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8058,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"伊孝子","author":"范梈","text":"是州宁有古藤君，子弟班班行义闻。\n又说水村烟郭外，伊家水树抹青云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8059,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]